name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-lesson2-cfu_2026'
title 'Check for Understanding'

question 'Question'

wrong 'Event listener — it waits for the click to happen.'
right 'Event handler — it runs when the click is detected.'
wrong 'Element selector — it points to the button on the page.'
wrong 'Variable that stores the track name.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

markdown <<MARKDOWN
A music app has this code:

```
const playBtn = document.getElementById("play");
playBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
    songTitle.textContent = "Now playing: Track 1";
});
```

The arrow function `() => { songTitle.textContent = "Now playing: Track 1"; }` is the:
